{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの必殺技募集にご協力いただきありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく迷うよ、これ＿|￣|○"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"決まったやつは、次の握手会のときに"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「必殺技お願いします」って言ってくれたらやります。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次の握手会は9月28日の幕張！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"え？全握ではやらないよ？恥ずかしいもん。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個別握手会のときのみ、あみの必殺技は作動します。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お楽しみに〜だねっ( *｀ω´)❤️❤️❤️"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あみが必殺技をやるなんてレアだよめちゃくちゃ！！笑\nまだ募集するから皆さんどしどしあみの必殺技ください。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もしかしたら、あなたのを採用するかもしれません...(￣(工)￣)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会でした！名古屋！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"モバメで問題を出したこの後ろ姿だ〜れ？の答えは......"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/23/9857611/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回の全国握手会のペア、七瀬でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"当たった方がほとんどかな？笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/23/9857611/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"七瀬のファンの皆様、お付き合いいただきありがとうございましたっ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルの相方は寧々でした（＾ν＾）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寧々と一緒になるのは初めてだけど\n寧々はあみがどんな普通の話をしても笑いころげてくれるツボの浅すぎる娘だから、\nなんだか自分がめちゃくちゃおもしろい人になった気分になったよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがと寧々ちゃん。えるおーぶい いー、LOVEだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして個別握手会"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"服はこんな感じでよぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/23/9857611/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"白いスカートお気に入りだよぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"オレンジのベルトはあみあみ族カラー意識だよぉ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"首元にお花がいっぱい咲いてるんだよぉ。\n（芦田愛菜さん風）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"......それにしても本当に芦田愛菜さんにはお世話になってます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつかお会いしたときお礼を言わなくちゃ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まあ正確には芦田愛菜さんのモノマネをする やしろ優さんのモノマネをさせていただいてるだけなんだけどね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/23/9857611/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三つ編み気に入った。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今後三つ編み率増えるかもっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三つ編みあみ。あみあみ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/ami.noujo/img/blog/ami.noujo/img/2014/09/23/9857611/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ピカ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も一個服着替えたけど写真撮るの忘れちった！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"乃木天のBBQのときに着た服だったよ、庭に田んぼがありそうな娘みたいな格好。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin6